window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v26-030-f0bc661a591461cc.json"]={sha256:"f0bc661a591461ccc51cca48dc7e35c04393a16b9e591f5116f10f1cb4d9639f",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-3d0919c53260f599","url":"https://docs.suricata.io/en/suricata-8.0.2/output/eve/eve-json-output.html","title":"Suricata 8.0.2 EVE JSON output","titleEn":"Suricata 8.0.2 EVE JSON output","publisher":"OISF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-030","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-030","related":[{"id":"security-v26-031","referenceUrls":["https://sigmahq.io/docs/basics/rules.html"],"title":"Sigma 偵測規則：布林條件與誤報真值表","titleEn":"Sigma detections: Boolean conditions and false-positive truth tables","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：1500000與2250000不被當索引容量；所有警報有來源與動作證據，缺資料不被誤寫為無異常。 交付EVE欄位契約、兩組輸入負載與警報/流量/損失關聯圖。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Do not label 1500000 or 2250000 as indexed-storage demand; preserve source/action evidence and never report missing data as no anomaly. Deliver the EVE field contract, two ingest budgets and alert/flow/loss relationships.","difference":"為無害的合成程序日誌設計selection與filter；先列AND、OR與NOT真值表，再將每個測試案例連到規則預期，避免直接套到正式告警。","differenceEn":"Design selection and filter over harmless synthetic process logs; enumerate AND/OR/NOT truth tables and bind each fixture to expected behavior before production alerting.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["輸入位元組率=事件率×平均序列化大小；有警報不等於已封鎖，alert action與實際處置需分開理解。 教學感測器每秒2000事件，平均每事件750位元組；不含傳輸、索引與副本開銷。 2000×750=1500000位元組/秒；事件率增至3000時為2250000位元組/秒。","precision=TP/(TP+FP)，recall=TP/(TP+FN)；修改過濾器時兩者都要檢查，不能只減少警報。 固定測試集有20個應偵測樣本與80個正常樣本；TP18、FN2、FP6、TN74。 precision=18/(18+6)×100=75%，recall=90%；FP降2且TP維持18時precision=90%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Ingest byte rate is event rate×average serialized size; an alert does not prove blocking, and alert action must be interpreted separately from actual enforcement. A teaching sensor emits 2000 events/s averaging 750 bytes, excluding transport, indexing and replication overhead. 2000×750=1500000 bytes/s; 3000 events/s requires 2250000 bytes/s.","Precision=TP/(TP+FP) and recall=TP/(TP+FN); evaluate both after filtering changes instead of only reducing alert volume. A fixed set has 20 labeled positives and 80 normal fixtures: TP18, FN2, FP6 and TN74. Precision=18/(18+6)×100=75% and recall=90%; reducing FP to 2 with TP18 yields precision 90%.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v26-040","referenceUrls":["https://docs.suricata.io/en/suricata-8.0.2/rules/thresholding.html"],"title":"Suricata 門檻：告警抑制與偵測品質","titleEn":"Suricata thresholds: alert suppression and detection quality","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：1500000與2250000不被當索引容量；所有警報有來源與動作證據，缺資料不被誤寫為無異常。 交付EVE欄位契約、兩組輸入負載與警報/流量/損失關聯圖。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Do not label 1500000 or 2250000 as indexed-storage demand; preserve source/action evidence and never report missing data as no anomaly. Deliver the EVE field contract, two ingest budgets and alert/flow/loss relationships.","difference":"以一個來源在固定60秒窗內的12個無害匹配時間點，紙面模擬type threshold每累積N個匹配才告警並重置；與limit、detection_filter分開。","differenceEn":"Use 12 harmless matches from one source within a fixed 60-second window to model type threshold alerting/reset every N matches; distinguish limit and detection_filter.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["輸入位元組率=事件率×平均序列化大小；有警報不等於已封鎖，alert action與實際處置需分開理解。 教學感測器每秒2000事件，平均每事件750位元組；不含傳輸、索引與副本開銷。 2000×750=1500000位元組/秒；事件率增至3000時為2250000位元組/秒。","在單一視窗、不跨重置邊界的教學序列，threshold告警數=floor(matches/N)；此式不套用其他門檻類型或封鎖動作。 同一來源12次匹配都在單一60秒窗內，N=3，起始計數為0。 floor(12/3)=4次告警；N改4時floor(12/4)=3次。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Ingest byte rate is event rate×average serialized size; an alert does not prove blocking, and alert action must be interpreted separately from actual enforcement. A teaching sensor emits 2000 events/s averaging 750 bytes, excluding transport, indexing and replication overhead. 2000×750=1500000 bytes/s; 3000 events/s requires 2250000 bytes/s.","For this single-window teaching sequence, threshold alerts=floor(matches/N); do not apply the formula to other threshold types or blocking actions. One source has 12 matches in one 60-second window, N=3 and initial count zero. floor(12/3)=4 alerts; N=4 gives floor(12/4)=3.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-46d8e1725e039768","url":"https://sigmahq.io/docs/basics/rules.html","title":"Sigma Detection Format: Rules","titleEn":"Sigma Detection Format: Rules","publisher":"SigmaHQ","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-65223a8c9b41afa5","url":"https://docs.suricata.io/en/suricata-8.0.2/rules/thresholding.html","title":"Suricata 8.0.2 thresholding keywords","titleEn":"Suricata 8.0.2 thresholding keywords","publisher":"OISF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
